{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-12-16 10:00:00', 'title': 'KROGER FULFILLMENT NETWORK EXPANDS IN INDIANAPOLIS AREA', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, DEC. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA\'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER, TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXPANSION OF ITS\xa0KROGER FULFILLMENT NETWORK. THE ADDITION OF A DELIVERY\xa0"SPOKE" BRINGS INNOVATION AND MODERN E-COMMERCE TO THE INDIANAPOLIS AREA, EXTENDING THE GROCER\'S REACH AND ABILITY TO PROVIDE ITS CUSTOMERS ANYTHING, ANYTIME, ANYWHERE.'}